5.查看 BMC 狀態 
  busctl get-property xyz.openbmc_project.State.BMC /xyz/openbmc_project/state/bmc0 xyz.openbmc_project.State.BMC CurrentBMCState
⭐️ Result
s "xyz.openbmc_project.State.BMC.BMCState.NotReady"

6.檢視指定物件底下的所有介面與屬性
  busctl introspect xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host /xyz/openbmc_project/state/host0
⭐️ Result
s "xyz.openbmc_project.State.BMC.BMCState.Quiesced"

7.讀取 D-Bus 物件的特定屬性數值
  busctl get-property xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host /xyz/openbmc_project/state/host0 xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host RequestedHostTransition
⭐️ Result
s "xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host.Transition.Off"

8.透過 D-Bus 發送方法呼叫（例如執行開機指令）
busctl call xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host /
xyz/openbmc_project/state/host0 xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host SetHostTransition s xyz.openbmc_project.State.Host.Transition.On

